          "description": "Returns the swap rate between the underlying token and PT/YT, in both directions.\n\nRates are expressed per 1 token (e.g. 1 WETH, not 1 wei). Data is returned with corresponding asset decimals and updated every block. `null` indicates the swap cannot be done (insufficient liquidity or market has matured).\n\nImplied APY of the market is also included.",
