              "type": "number",
              "description": "Static rough ETA for the action, in seconds. Chain-aware (reads viem block time) × per-action iter count + workflow overhead. Render as \"est. ~X min\" — NOT precise; the actual run can exceed it on slow blocks / aggregator retries."
